#: src/main.cpp:368
msgid ""
"Openbox requires an X11 compositor for complete window previews. Display "
"Preview is disabled. Start compton or picom, then enable Display Preview in "
"DockLight Settings."
msgstr ""
"To'liq oynani oldindan ko'rish uchun Openbox X11 kompozitorini talab qiladi. "
"Displeyni oldindan ko‘rish o‘chirilgan. Compton yoki picom-ni ishga "
"tushiring, keyin DockLight sozlamalarida Displeyni oldindan ko'rishni yoqing."

